(6862829, 1033491, 10785, '<td valign="top">Wonderful bright lighting makes for a very beautiful portrait! Not much I can pick on here to critique about the technique, but if I could mention one thing it would be the pose. I think the flower is a little high and hides the face a little too much, also the hands don''t look delicate enough to suite the delicate nature of the girl.</td>', 'Wonderful bright lighting makes for a very beautiful portrait! Not much I can pick on here to critique about the technique, but if I could mention one thing it would be the pose. I think the flower is a little high and hides the face a little too much, also the hands don''t look delicate enough to suite the delicate nature of the girl.', '2012-09-13 10:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6862836, 1033470, 113156, '<td valign="top">Although I''m not getting a great sense of backlighting, I find this a very nice shot, well done.</td>', 'Although I''m not getting a great sense of backlighting, I find this a very nice shot, well done.', '2012-09-13 10:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
