(6862842, 1033403, 10785, '<td valign="top">It could be an otical illusion, but to me the horizon seems to be tilted to the right. The mountain is sloping that way I know, but it just seems to be off rotation. Looking at the tree trunks, they appear to all be leaning right.</td>', 'It could be an otical illusion, but to me the horizon seems to be tilted to the right. The mountain is sloping that way I know, but it just seems to be off rotation. Looking at the tree trunks, they appear to all be leaning right.', '2012-09-13 11:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
