(6865616, 1033372, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1<br/>Don''t know what it is, but I really like this. I can''t figure out what she''s walking towards and it adds mystery to the scene. Why are you standing ten feet behind her? There''s enough I''m trying to figure out, and that alone is why I voted this so high, it makes me want to figure it out.</td>', '#1Don''t know what it is, but I really like this. I can''t figure out what she''s walking towards and it adds mystery to the scene. Why are you standing ten feet behind her? There''s enough I''m trying to figure out, and that alone is why I voted this so high, it makes me want to figure it out.', '2012-09-18 23:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
