(6866387, 1033423, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done! I too wonder what it would be like cropped up from the bottom. The first time I saw it, I wanted a little fill on the face. It seemed dark. The next time I saw it I wanted a little fill on the face, it seemed to dark.<br/> <br/>Yet each time, after the initial thought of lighting it, I kept thinking how intriguing the dark was. It made me want more. It made me wonder about what she was thinking. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Very nicely done! I too wonder what it would be like cropped up from the bottom. The first time I saw it, I wanted a little fill on the face. It seemed dark. The next time I saw it I wanted a little fill on the face, it seemed to dark. Yet each time, after the initial thought of lighting it, I kept thinking how intriguing the dark was. It made me want more. It made me wonder about what she was thinking.  ', '2012-09-19 22:46:28.000000', NULL, 0),
